      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Elizabeth boasts several firsts, including the first ice‑cream soda, the first Singer sewing machine, the first submarine, and the first assembly‑line automobile producer in New Jersey.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        27
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
